{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05484","headline":"赠张丞相 · 宋鼎","name":"赠张丞相","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉上登飞幰，荆南历旧居。\n已尝临砌橘，更覩跃池鱼。\n盛德继微渺，深衷能卷舒。\n义申蓬阁际，情切庙堂初。\n郡挹文章美，人怀燮理余。\n皇恩傥照亮，岂厌承明庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}